                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ4cI98NepQjQR3Uy-HdOy5k8/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5RFNqUTVaVlozT0dNMloyaG5kMFZ5VldKU1FXYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "9 個月前",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "開在夜市裡面的興新早餐店，感覺起來蠻像網美店的，但是餐點的品項上也確實蠻不錯的。\n排骨吐司的排骨是用傳統的滷排骨便當中的排骨作法去做，先炸後滷，讓醬汁都吸附到排骨裡面，加上非常厚實又有彈性帶有醬香的排骨肉，讓人能在早餐就能吃到排骨，很舒服很開心很好吃。\n馬鈴薯蛋吐司就是馬鈴薯泥加滑蛋，是比較清爽但是味道也不錯的吐司，馬鈴薯泥微綿，也算是不錯的一樣。\n芋頭丸非常芋頭，能吃到濃濃的芋頭味道而且不會太有澱粉感。紅茶有甜但不會死甜或澀口。\n算是想要吃吐司類早餐或早午餐的時候會推薦的一家店。\nIt is a new breakfast shop located in the night market. The items are good, even if it feels like a influencer-style shop. The cooking method for the deep-fried pork chop follows the traditional way, based on the Taiwanese traditional deep-fried pork chop,deep-frying them first and then braising them to absorb the sauce. The chop is thick and elastic, with a fragrant sauce flavor absorbed into the pork chop. It is really comfortable, happy, and delicious to eat the deep-fried pork chop in the morning.\nThe potato paste toast with egg is a combination of potato paste and stir-fried egg. The potato paste is smooth, and the flavor is fresh. It is also a good choice.\nThe taro ball has an incredibly taro flavor and texture. You can enjoy the rich taro flavor without the starchiness. The black tea is neither sweet nor astringent.\nIt is a breakfast or brunch shop that I would recommend if I would like to eat toast.",
                                     "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "開在夜市裡面的興新早餐店，感覺起來蠻像網美店的，但是餐點的品項上也確實蠻不錯的。\n排骨吐司的排骨是用傳統的滷排骨便當中的排骨作法去做，先炸後滷，讓醬汁都吸附到排骨裡面，加上非常厚實又有彈性帶有醬香的排骨肉，讓人能在早餐就能吃到排骨，很舒服很開心很好吃。\n馬鈴薯蛋吐司就是馬鈴薯泥加滑蛋，是比較清爽但是味道也不錯的吐司，馬鈴薯泥微綿，也算是不錯的一樣。\n芋頭丸非常芋頭，能吃到濃濃的芋頭味道而且不會太有澱粉感。紅茶有甜但不會死甜或澀口。\n算是想要吃吐司類早餐或早午餐的時候會推薦的一家店。\nIt is a new breakfast shop located in the night market. The items are good, even if it feels like a influencer-style shop. The cooking method for the deep-fried pork chop follows the traditional way, based on the Taiwanese traditional deep-fried pork chop,deep-frying them first and then braising them to absorb the sauce. The chop is thick and elastic, with a fragrant sauce flavor absorbed into the pork chop. It is really comfortable, happy, and delicious to eat the deep-fried pork chop in the morning.\nThe potato paste toast with egg is a combination of potato paste and stir-fried egg. The potato paste is smooth, and the flavor is fresh. It is also a good choice.\nThe taro ball has an incredibly taro flavor and texture. You can enjoy the rich taro flavor without the starchiness. The black tea is neither sweet nor astringent.\nIt is a breakfast or brunch shop that I would recommend if I would like to eat toast.",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
